# An allow-list: the API's image builds from these alone (cmd/api/Dockerfile),
# so everything else (docs, tests, tooling, other services' files, local env
# files) stays out of the build context, and a new top-level directory doesn't
# end up in it unnoticed.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!flagd/
!internal/
!cmd/api/

# Tests and their data aren't part of the binary.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
